cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in research or production, please cite it as below."
title: "Agrolane: A Location-Based Retrieval Workbench for County Agricultural Matching"
abstract: >-
  Agrolane (农道) is a full-stack workbench for agricultural brokers and supply-chain integrators.
  It stores upstream and downstream entities in a local SQLite ledger, performs geohash
  prefix-indexed geo retrieval around a manually entered origin, fuses geo, content and
  popularity recall channels with reciprocal rank fusion, and ranks candidates with an
  explainable weighted model (content similarity, fulfillment/credit, price fit, distance).
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Yunchuan"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-21"
license: MIT
